restricted code fiber admissible, without splitting it or imposing
a common donor for different targets. The product law has total
mass one and each fiber mass at most $C^{2^{D-9}}$. Count the
unchanged complete names. This is the credited transport with
the new cap, preserving all variable shapes, all original targets
and arbitrary off-target queries in the competitor class.
$\square$

